# Kuya Kap - Unified Everyday Purchase Timeline (3-Slot Sandwich Pattern)
# Shifts ONLY on meaningful story flags (Flag_KapQuitSmoking / Flag_KapSubCandy).
# Voice: Homey Filipino elderly tito. Zero time-of-day markers. Zero em-dashes.

label Greeting
# Slot 1: P1-P3 Reactive Opener or High-Price Remark
if {Transaction_HasReactiveOpener}:
	KuyaKap: {Transaction_ReactiveOpener}
elif {Global_HighPriceActive}:
	KuyaKap: Uy, prices crept up a bit, ha? Times are tight on the road.

# Slot 2: Upfront Utang Ask OR Flag-Driven Request Pool (4 grounded variations per state)
if {Transaction_WantsDebt}:
	KuyaKap: O, apo, walked across the road for [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], kaso I left my coin pouch in my other shirt.
	KuyaKap: Pwede bang ilista muna? I'll bring the coins on my next walk over, promise.
	- Sure Kuya, I'll put it on the list.
		[signal arg="utang_accepted"]
		KuyaKap: Salamat, nak. Grab [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] whenever your hands are free.
	- Sorry Kuya, cash is tight at the register right now.
		[signal arg="utang_rejected"]
		KuyaKap: Ay, oo naman, business first. Let me walk back to my tree and fetch my coins.
elif {Flag_KapQuitSmoking}:
	if {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 25:
		KuyaKap: O, apo. Pahingi nga ng [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color]. Lungs feel lighter lately.
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 50:
		KuyaKap: Just stretching my legs from the acacia. Let me grab [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], nak.
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 75:
		KuyaKap: Funny how much clearer the road smells without tobacco. [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] nga, apo.
	else:
		KuyaKap: Heto barya, nak. [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] lang for your oldest suki.
elif {Flag_KapSubCandy}:
	if {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 25:
		KuyaKap: Don't look at me like that, I'm behaving. Just [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], apo.
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 50:
		KuyaKap: My pockets are full of candy wrappers because of you. Pahingi ng [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], nak.
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 75:
		KuyaKap: Taking a short walk to keep my hands busy. Let me get [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], apo.
	else:
		KuyaKap: O, nak, [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] lang. And no lectures from behind the counter, ha.
else:
	if {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 25:
		KuyaKap: O, apo. Quick walk across the road. Pahingi nga ng [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 50:
		KuyaKap: Stepping out of the shade for a minute. Let me get [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], nak.
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 75:
		KuyaKap: Tindahan's looking tidy, apo. [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] nga when your hands are free.
	else:
		KuyaKap: Heto barya, nak. Just [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] for me.
[end_timeline]

label Talk
KuyaKap: No rush, apo. My old knees like the break anyway. Still need [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].
- Coming right up, Kuya.
	[end_timeline]
- Sorry Kuya, we're out of stock right now.
	KuyaKap: Ay, ubos na? Sige, nak, I'll check back after Mario passes through.
	[signal arg="refuse_service"]
	[end_timeline]

label Partial
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	KuyaKap: Salamat, nak. Still waiting on [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] whenever you're ready.
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	KuyaKap: Got this one. Just [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] left on my list, apo.
else:
	KuyaKap: Ayos, thanks. No rush on [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], my knees like the rest.
[end_timeline]

label Satisfy
if {Transaction_WantsDebt}:
	KuyaKap: Salamat ulit, nak. Don't forget to jot that down in your lista, ha.
else:
	if {Global_TipActive}:
		KuyaKap: Keep the extra coins, apo. Buy yourself merienda later.
	elif {Transaction_SatisfyVar} < 34:
		KuyaKap: Ayos. Salamat, apo. Don't forget to sit down between customers, ha.
	elif {Transaction_SatisfyVar} < 67:
		KuyaKap: Salamat, nak. Just wave across the road if anyone gives you a hard time.
	else:
		KuyaKap: Sakto 'yan. Back to my shade, apo.
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Repayment
KuyaKap: First things first, apo. Here's the {Transaction_RepaymentAmount} pesos I owed from last time.
[signal arg="repay_debt"]
KuyaKap: Sakto 'yan. You can cross my name off your lista now, nak.
[end_timeline]

label WrongItem
KuyaKap: Uy, wrong grab, apo. I asked for [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].
[end_timeline]
